      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s an alpha?! An alpha Shiny Feebas?!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThis is kind of too much—and it looks a little\nscary—but thanks a whole lot!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
