    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, it’s you again. I decided to release Feebas into\nthe water here so it can befriend the Magikarp.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They’re both categorized as Fish Pokémon, after\nall. I bet they’ll get along very well.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThough I do think I heard something about not\nreleasing wild Pokémon into new environments...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
